{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"kind\":\"final\",\"decision\":\"answer\",\"answer\":466,\"evidence\":[\"receipt-1\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"reason\":\"Dynamic programming over runs of length 1 and 2 gives 466 strings of length 12 avoiding 000 and 111.\"}","reasoning_content":"We need count binary strings length 12 that avoid forbidden substrings \"000\" and \"111\". Count sequences with no 3 consecutive same bits. This is classic: number of binary strings of length n with no run of 3 equal bits. We can use recurrence. Let a_n be number of strings length n ending with run of length 1 of some bit, b_n ending with run length 2. Actually we need track last run length and bit? But symmetry: counts for ending with 0 or 1 same. So let A_n = number ending with run length 1 (i.e., last two bits different or n=1). B_n = number ending with run length 2 (i.e., last two bits same but third last different or n=2). Recurrence: For next bit, if we add opposite bit, run length becomes 1. If we add same bit, run length increases by 1 but only allowed if previous run length was 1. So:\n\nA_{n+1} = A_n + B_n (adding opposite to any string)\nB_{n+1} = A_n (adding same to strings with run length 1)\n\nBase n=1: strings \"0\",\"1\": both run length1. So A_1=2, B_1=0.\n\nCompute up to n=12.\n\nLet's iterate.\n\nn=1: A=2 B=0 total=2\nn=2: A2 = A1+B1 =2+0=2 ; B2 = A1=2 ; total=4\nn=3: A3 = A2+B2 =2+2=4 ; B3 = A2=2 ; total=6\nn=4: A4 = A3+B3 =4+2=6 ; B4 = A3=4 ; total=10\nn=5: A5 = A4+B4 =6+4=10 ; B5 = A4=6 ; total=16\nn=6: A6 = A5+B5 =10+6=16 ; B6 = A5=10 ; total=26\nn=7: A7 = A6+B6 =16+10=26 ; B7 = A6=16 ; total=42\nn=8: A8 = A7+B7 =26+16=42 ; B8 = A7=26 ; total=68\nn=9: A9 = A8+B8 =42+26=68 ; B9 = A8=42 ; total=110\nn=10: A10 = A9+B9 =68+42=110 ; B10 = A9=68 ; total=178\nn=11: A11 = A10+B10 =110+68=178 ; B11 = A10=110 ; total=288\nn=12: A12 = A11+B11 =178+110=288 ; B12 = A11=178 ; total=466\n\nThus answer 466."}}],"created":1790947041,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":701,"prompt_tokens":4111,"total_tokens":4812,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-29tM5Uvnhy5YxUGjJBA7qtZJbuKUdd1a","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4111,"prompt_ms":496.379,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12074410119192411,"prompt_per_second":8281.978085293696,"predicted_n":701,"predicted_ms":2162.448,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.0892114285714283,"predicted_per_second":323.7072059073791}}